ensitivity arms included only after the primary 5-arm comparison is locked in.\\n\\nStatus. I am waiting for researcher approval on the 6 blocks-approval items above before I write the full design. No experiment has been run. No numerical outcomes are claimed. Supporting probe notes are saved at /workspace/notes/initial_inspection.md.\\n\", \"evidence\": \"Environment probe output during inspection. Python 3.12.3 on Linux x86_64 with 24 CPUs and ~707 GB free on /workspace. pip is not on PATH (find only surfaced a non-runnable pip source dir). Network is disabled (curl to pypi.org returns Could not resolve host). python3 -c \\\"import X\\\" yields ModuleNotFoundError for torch, torchopt, numpy and scipy. find found no torch and no torchopt directories on disk. /workspace contains only /workspace/task.json whose embedded documents.track.md confirms a design-only scope. I saved probe notes to /workspace/notes/initial_inspection.md. No TorchOpt symbols are locally verified; every TorchOpt symbol in the plan is flagged as proposed-to-validate or assumption and is grounded in publicly documented TorchOpt behavior rather than local source.\", \"assumptions\": [\"default init target is iMAML inner init; MetaSGD secondary\", \"first-order implicit ok as within-arm baseline condition\", \"no offline datasets so synthetic Gaussian task default\", \"Tier B functorch path valid swap-in for Tier A TorchOpt path\", \"TorchOpt not installed and cannot be installed here\", \"CPU-only design across all arms and seeds\", \"inner optimizer SGD with per-parameter LR via MetaSGD or fallback\", \"damping default 1e-2 sweep range from 1e-3 to 1e-1\"], \"uncertainties\": [\"blocks approval: offline dataset availability and substitution choice\", \"blocks approval: compute budget per arm and success thresholds\", \"blocks approval: regression only or both regression and classification\", \"blocks approval: first-order or second-order implicit requirement\", \"blocks approval: target of differentiation init or per-parameter meta params\", \"blocks approval: which TorchOpt version and which implicit-diff entry point\", \"minor default: Neumann depth K and CG iters T sweep grid defaults\", \"minor default: number of seeds and meta-test split size\"]}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-7c538ff8-3a13-4e43-bef8-388f8fcac6cc", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 39}
